# PE Lab platform ({{ pelab_domain }})

Generated by pe-lab-ansible. Keep this file private.

## Core platform

| Service | URL | Instructor login |
|---|---|---|
| Developer portal (Backstage) | https://{{ pelab_hosts.backstage }} | guest sign-in (no password: anyone who reaches the portal can read the catalog) |
| Gitea (code, pull requests, pipelines) | https://{{ pelab_hosts.gitea }} | {{ pelab_gitea_admin_user }} / {{ pelab_gitea_admin_password }} |
| Harbor (images, scans, SBOMs) | https://{{ pelab_hosts.harbor }} | admin / {{ pelab_harbor_admin_password }} |
| Argo CD (deployments) | https://{{ pelab_hosts.argocd }} | admin / `sudo k3s kubectl -n argocd get secret argocd-initial-admin-secret -o jsonpath='{.data.password}' \| base64 -d`; delegates: {{ pelab_viewer_user }} / {{ pelab_viewer_password }} (read-only) |
| Grafana (dashboards, logs) | https://{{ pelab_hosts.grafana }} | admin / {{ pelab_grafana_admin_password }}; delegates: {{ pelab_viewer_user }} / {{ pelab_viewer_password }} (Viewer) |
| Prometheus | https://{{ pelab_hosts.prometheus }} | {{ pelab_viewer_user }} / {{ pelab_viewer_password }} (the browser asks; delegates use the same) |
| Alertmanager | https://{{ pelab_hosts.alertmanager }} | {{ pelab_viewer_user }} / {{ pelab_viewer_password }} (the browser asks; anyone signed in can add silences) |

Delegates sign in to Gitea, Harbor and code-server as `studentNN` with their own
password, and to Argo CD and Grafana with the read-only login `{{ pelab_viewer_user }}` /
{{ pelab_viewer_password }} (its random part is `{{ pelab_password_dir }}/delegate-viewer.txt`; every machine built from the repository has the same passwords).
Traefik asks for the same login in front of Prometheus and Alertmanager. Only the
portal has no login. Each delegate's logins are in `{{ pelab_credentials_dir }}/logins/studentNN.md`
and in their workspace (`cat /etc/pelab/logins.md`); on a delegate's own VM also in
`/etc/pelab/logins.md` on the host.
{% if pelab_shared_logins | bool %}

Role-play logins (`pelab_shared_logins: true`): `{{ pelab_reviewer_user }}` / {{ pelab_reviewer_password }}
is in every team, so its approval counts on the team's services; `{{ pelab_platform_approver_user }}` /
{{ pelab_platform_approver_password }} is the platform team, whose approval counts on
platform/environments and platform/policies (it can read and review there, nothing else).
{% endif %}

## Golden path

- Template: https://{{ pelab_hosts.gitea }}/{{ golden_path_platform_org }}/{{ golden_path_template_repo }}
  (create a service: https://{{ pelab_hosts.gitea }}/repo/create?template_id={{ golden_path_template_id }})
- Portal catalog: https://{{ pelab_hosts.gitea }}/{{ golden_path_platform_org }}/{{ golden_path_catalog_repo }}
- Dashboard: https://{{ pelab_hosts.grafana }}/d/pelab-golden-path

| Team | Starter repository | Dev | Staging | Prod |
|---|---|---|---|---|
{% for team in pelab_team_names %}
| {{ team }} | https://{{ pelab_hosts.gitea }}/{{ team }}/{{ golden_path_starter_repo }} | https://{{ golden_path_starter_repo }}-{{ team }}-dev.{{ pelab_domain }} | https://{{ golden_path_starter_repo }}-{{ team }}-staging.{{ pelab_domain }} | https://{{ golden_path_starter_repo }}-{{ team }}-prod.{{ pelab_domain }} |
{% endfor %}

Pipelines push as Harbor robot `{{ golden_path_robot.name | default('robot$' ~ golden_path_robot_name) }}`; Argo CD and Backstage read Gitea as `{{ golden_path_bot_user }}`.
{% if golden_path_signing | bool %}

Image signing is on: pipelines sign with `{{ golden_path_cosign_key_file }}` (password in
`{{ pelab_credentials_dir }}/cosign-password.txt`), and the Kyverno policy `pelab-signed-images`
checks signatures with `{{ golden_path_cosign_pub_file }}` (audit only).
{% endif %}

